- **REQ-002/TEST-011**: TXDATA write returns SLVERR when FIFO full
- **REQ-004/PROP-010/TEST-030**: IRQ assertion when enabled condition is true
- **REQ-005/TEST-040**: BAUD divider update takes effect on subsequent frames
- **Node-02**: CSR decode, read/write response, WSTRB support
- **Node-07**: Interrupt generation, RW1C for IRQ_STAT
