### Design Decisions
1. Single `rtl_module` unit as specified
2. AXI-Lite read/write paths separated for clarity (per HINT-010)
3. Explicit side-effect semantics in spec (per HINT-014): RXDATA read pops FIFO, IRQ_STAT is RW1C
4. Canonical ports derived from AXI-Lite standard and UART integration needs

